      <h2 class="section__title">Frequently Asked Questions About Bangladesh Clothing Manufacturers</h2>
      
      <div class="faq">
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">What is the minimum order quantity for clothing manufacturers in Bangladesh?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">
            Most Bangladesh garment factories have MOQs ranging from 300 to 1,000 pieces per style. At SDF Clothing, we offer 300 piece minimums per style with flexible size and color combinations, making us ideal for startup brands and boutique labels. Some large manufacturers require 2,000+ pieces, but many mid-sized factories accommodate smaller orders for the right partnership.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">Why choose Bangladesh for clothing manufacturing?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">
            Bangladesh offers competitive labor costs, skilled workforce, government incentives for exports, duty-free access to EU markets through EBA (until November 2026), and established infrastructure. The country is the world's second-largest garment exporter with $47 billion in annual exports. The combination of cost advantage, quality capability, and trade preferences makes Bangladesh attractive for fashion brands globally.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">How long does clothing production take in Bangladesh?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">
            Standard lead time for bulk production is 40-45 days from fabric sourcing to shipment. Sample development takes 7-14 days. Shipping adds 20-40 days depending on destination. We provide clear timeline commitments and track production closely to ensure on-time delivery for your fashion brand. Rush orders may be possible at higher cost.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">What certifications should I look for in a Bangladesh clothing manufacturer?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">
            Key certifications include GOTS (organic cotton), OEKO-TEX (chemical safety), BSCI (social compliance), WRAP (ethical manufacturing), ISO 9001 (quality management), and C-TPAT (supply chain security). SDF Clothing holds 13 international certifications covering quality, social compliance, and environmental standards. Always verify certifications with issuing organizations.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">What are the payment terms for Bangladesh clothing manufacturers?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">
            Standard payment terms are 30% deposit to start production and 70% before shipment. We accept T/T (wire transfer), Letter of Credit (L/C), and bank transfers. For established clients, we offer flexible payment arrangements based on order volume and relationship history. Never pay 100% upfront - this eliminates your quality leverage.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">How does Bangladesh LDC graduation affect clothing manufacturing in 2026?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">
            Bangladesh graduates from Least Developed Country status in November 2026, which will remove EU duty-free access under EBA. However, Bangladesh is negotiating new trade agreements and many manufacturers are preparing for this transition. Working with certified manufacturers like SDF ensures compliance readiness. The impact will vary by product category and specific trade agreements negotiated.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">What services do Bangladesh clothing manufacturers offer?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">
            Full-service manufacturers offer OEM (original equipment manufacturing), private label production, CMT (cut-make-trim), fabric sourcing, tech pack development, sampling, quality control, and logistics coordination. SDF provides end-to-end solutions from design to delivery. Some manufacturers specialize in specific services - clarify what's included in your quote.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">How do I find a reliable clothing manufacturer in Bangladesh?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">
            Look for BGMEA or BKMEA membership, verify certifications with issuing bodies, request factory audits, check client references, and start with sample orders. Reliable manufacturers are transparent about capabilities, pricing, and lead times. Visit the factory if possible or request a video tour. SDF welcomes factory visits and video consultations for qualified clients.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

